sequenceDiagram
    participant C as API client
    participant A as API
    participant CS as ChargesService
    participant F as ChargeDraftFactory
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>A: POST /patients/patientId/charges/from-treatment-plan/planId with itemIds
    A->>CS: fromTreatmentPlan, needs billing.desk.use
    CS->>DB: begin transaction, load plan of this patient
    CS->>DB: load the listed items of this plan
    CS->>F: one charge draft per item, source TREATMENT_PLAN
    F-->>CS: price = item estimate, else 0 with needs pricing
    CS->>DB: insert charges, skip items already charged
    CS->>DB: write billing audit rows for new charges
    CS-->>C: the charges created
